{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20093","headline":"送任载齐古二秀才自洞庭游宣城 · 孟郊","name":"送任载齐古二秀才自洞庭游宣城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭非人境，道路行虚空。\n二客月中下，一帆天外风。\n鱼龙波五色，金碧树千丛。\n闪怪如可惧，在诚无不通。\n扣奇知浩淼，采异访穹崇。\n物表即高韵，人间访仙公。\n宣城文雅地，谢守声闻融。\n证玉易爲力，辨珉谁不同。\n从兹阮籍泪，且免泣途穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}